@TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress = http://localhost:5179

GET {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/universities
Accept: application/json

###

### Register a learner
POST {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Learner",
  "email": "test.learner@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "grade": 11,
  "language": "English",
  "track": "Science"
}

###

### Log in (copy the returned token into @token below)
POST {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.learner@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

###

@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN

### Get current learner profile
GET {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/learners/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update current learner profile
PUT {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/learners/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Learner",
  "grade": 12,
  "language": "English",
  "track": "Commerce"
}

###

### Elective subjects (non-compulsory)
GET {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/subjects?elective=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Calculate APS
POST {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/aps/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "subject": "English Home Language", "level": 6 },
  { "subject": "Mathematics", "level": 7 },
  { "subject": "Physical Sciences", "level": 6 },
  { "subject": "Life Sciences", "level": 5 },
  { "subject": "Afrikaans First Additional Language", "level": 5 },
  { "subject": "Geography", "level": 6 },
  { "subject": "Life Orientation", "level": 7 }
]

###

### Careers unlocked by subject combo
POST {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/careers/unlocked
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjects": ["Mathematics", "Physical Sciences", "English Home Language", "Life Sciences"]
}

###

### Get job-fit quiz questions
GET {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/assessment/questions
Accept: application/json

###

### Submit job-fit quiz answers (optionally authenticated to save the result)
POST {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/assessment/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "rating": 4 },
    { "questionId": 7, "rating": 5 },
    { "questionId": 13, "rating": 2 },
    { "questionId": 19, "rating": 5 },
    { "questionId": 25, "rating": 3 },
    { "questionId": 31, "rating": 4 }
  ]
}

###

### Get current learner's past assessment results
GET {{TertiaryInstitutions_HostAddress}}/api/learners/me/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
